WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.404 --> 00:00:04.127
Unit nineteen. Local Places and Landmarks!

2
00:00:05.234 --> 00:00:10.164
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:10.214 --> 00:00:13.871
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.921 --> 00:00:18.619
Today we learn: Local Places and Landmarks. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.785 --> 00:00:23.785
Landmark. Say it with me. Landmark!

6
00:00:27.309 --> 00:00:31.226
Monument. Say it with me. Monument!

7
00:00:34.724 --> 00:00:38.740
Museum. Say it with me. Museum!

8
00:00:42.224 --> 00:00:46.174
Historic. Say it with me. Historic!

9
00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:53.282
Visit. Say it with me. Visit!

10
00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:00.530
Local. Say it with me. Local!

11
00:01:04.032 --> 00:01:07.849
Famous. Say it with me. Famous!

12
00:01:11.352 --> 00:01:15.102
Tourist. Say it with me. Tourist!

13
00:01:18.616 --> 00:01:28.089
Grammar time! There is or are + landmark. Listen. There is a famous museum in my city.

14
00:01:28.139 --> 00:01:33.469
Your turn. Say it with me. There is a famous museum in my city.

15
00:01:38.251 --> 00:01:49.652
Every town has famous landmarks worth a visit. A historic monument or museum can teach visitors about local culture. Tourists often travel far just to see a famous landmark.

16
00:01:49.702 --> 00:01:51.076
I like this story!

17
00:01:51.777 --> 00:01:57.183
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:57.233 --> 00:01:58.383
Museum!

19
00:01:59.398 --> 00:02:04.548
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:04.598 --> 00:02:05.748
Famous!

21
00:02:06.757 --> 00:02:15.260
Think and answer. What is a famous landmark in your town or country?

22
00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:16.460
Great answer!

23
00:02:17.554 --> 00:02:20.365
This unit's value is Cultural Pride.

24
00:02:20.415 --> 00:02:22.476
I can show cultural pride every day!

25
00:02:23.158 --> 00:02:29.567
Well done! You finished Pre A one! See you in A one!

26
00:02:29.617 --> 00:02:33.231
Hooray! Bye-bye, friends!

